    <front>
      <div xml:id="starts-on">
        <pb ed="#P" n="0252A"/>
      </div>
    </front>
    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-lc3">
        <head xml:id="gom-lc3-Hd1e98">Caput 3</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-lc3-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-lc3-Hd1e102">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_2@7-9">Factum est verbum,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-lc3-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-lc3-Nd1e110" ref="#Bede">BEDA.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e113"><seg type="qs">Congregaturus Ecclesiam, Dei Filius primum operatur in servulo</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">unum itaque dixit, et omnia declaravit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-lc3-Dd1e122">
          <head xml:id="gom-lc3-Hd1e124">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e126">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e128" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_3@7-9">Praedicans baptismum poenitentiae,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-lc3-Rd1e131"><name xml:id="gom-lc3-Nd1e132" ref="#Bede">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e135"><seg type="qs">Joannes baptismum poenitentiae praedicavit, et quibusdam etiam dedit</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">praecurretur suo baptismate quo peccata solvi non possunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-lc3-Dd1e144">
          <head xml:id="gom-lc3-Hd1e146">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e148">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e150" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_4@9-10">Vox clamantis.</quote>
            Vox, quia praenuntius <pb ed="#P" n="0252B"/> verbi.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e156">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e158" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_4@11-12">In deserto.</quote>
            Quia desertae et destitutae Judaeae solatium redemptionis annuntiat. Nullum verbum sine voce auditur, nec vox sine verbi intelligentia valet.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e162">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e164" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_4@13-15">Parate viam Domini,</quote>
            etc. Qui fidem et bona opera praedicat, quid aliud quam venienti Domino? ad corda audientium viam parat, ut haec vis gratiae illustret, ut rectas Deo semitas faciat, dum mundas cogitationes in animo per sermonem praedicationis format.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-lc3-Dd1e169">
          <head xml:id="gom-lc3-Hd1e171">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e173">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e175" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_5@10-12">Et erunt prava.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-lc3-Rd1e178"><name xml:id="gom-lc3-Nd1e179" ref="#Bede">BEDA.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e182">Prava, id est, malorum corda per injustitiam distorta ad regulam justitiae dirigentur.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-lc3-Dd1e187">
          <head xml:id="gom-lc3-Hd1e189">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e191">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e193" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_6@1-2">Et videbit.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-lc3-Rd1e196"><name xml:id="gom-lc3-Nd1e197" ref="#Bede">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e200">In hac vita omnis homo Christum videre non potuit, sed in die judicii, in sede majestatis et electi et reprobi pariter videbunt, ut <pb ed="#P" n="0252C"/> justi remunerentur, et mali in aeternum gemant. Unde et subditur:</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-lc3-Dd1e207">
          <head xml:id="gom-lc3-Hd1e209">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e211">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e213" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_7@13-14">Quis ostendit,</quote>
            etc.?
            <ref xml:id="gom-lc3-Rd1e216"><name xml:id="gom-lc3-Nd1e217" ref="#Ambrose">AMBR.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e220"><seg type="qs">Quis ostendit in prudentia miseratione Dei infusa, etc.?</seg> usque ad <seg type="qs">quam ad gentes transferendam prophetat.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-lc3-Dd1e229">
          <head xml:id="gom-lc3-Hd1e231">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e233">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e235" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_8@13-15">Dico enim vobis.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-lc3-Rd1e238"><name xml:id="gom-lc3-Nd1e239" ref="#Ambrose">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e242"><seg type="qs">Qui amisso sensu rationis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">replentur fructibus, vestiuntur frondibus.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-lc3-Dd1e251">
          <head xml:id="gom-lc3-Hd1e253">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e255">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e257" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_11@5-7">Qui habet duas. (BEDA)</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e260"><seg type="qs">. Tunica plus sui necessaria quam pallium</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sed quod habet cum paupere partiat.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-lc3-Dd1e269">
          <head xml:id="gom-lc3-Hd1e271">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e273">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e275" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_12@4-4">Publicani.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-lc3-Rd1e278"><name xml:id="gom-lc3-Nd1e279" ref="#Ambrose">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e282"><seg type="qs">Qui vectigalia publica exigunt</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">tandem ad propria cum proximis communicanda pertingerent.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-lc3-Dd1e291">
          <head xml:id="gom-lc3-Hd1e293">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e295">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e297" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_15@1-2">Existimante autem.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-lc3-Rd1e300"><name xml:id="gom-lc3-Nd1e301" ref="#Ambrose">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e304"><seg type="qs">Non solum <pb ed="#P" n="0252D"/> cogitabant</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">per virginem venisse non credunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-lc3-Dd1e316">
          <head xml:id="gom-lc3-Hd1e318">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e320">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e322" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_16@10-11">Veniet autem.</quote>
            Ideo baptizo aqua, quia ille venit qui baptizabit spiritu, et oportet, ut illi via praeparetur.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e326">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e328" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_16@14-17">Cujus non sum dignus.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-lc3-Rd1e331"><name xml:id="gom-lc3-Nd1e332" ref="#Bede">BEDA.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e335"><seg type="qs">Non sum dignus mysterium incarnationis investigare</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">evangelica praedicatio, qua calceati sunt apostoli.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-lc3-Dd1e344">
          <head xml:id="gom-lc3-Hd1e346">Versus 19</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e348">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e350" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_19@1-1">Herodes.</quote>
            Antequam Lucas aliquid narrat de actibus Jesu, dicit Joannem ab Herode captum, ut ostendat se solummodo ea facta descripturum, quae eo anno gesta sunt, quo Joannes vel captus est, vel punitus.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-lc3-Dd1e355">
          <head xml:id="gom-lc3-Hd1e357">Versus 21</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e359">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e361" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_21@8-10">Et Jesu baptizato.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-lc3-Rd1e364"><name xml:id="gom-lc3-Nd1e365" ref="#Bede">BEDA.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e368"><seg type="qs">Baptizatur <pb ed="#P" n="0253A"/> Dominus, non mundari indigens</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">jam edoctus Dei Filium aperte praedicat.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-lc3-Dd1e379">
          <head xml:id="gom-lc3-Hd1e381">Versus 22</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e383">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e385" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_22@22-24">In te complacui.</quote>
            Non aliena in filio, sed sua laudatur, quasi dicat: Quaecunque habes tu, mea sunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-lc3-Dd1e390">
          <head xml:id="gom-lc3-Hd1e392">Versus 23</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e394">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e396" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_23@7-8">Annorum triginta.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-lc3-Rd1e399"><name xml:id="gom-lc3-Nd1e400" ref="#Bede">BEDA.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e403"><seg type="qs">Quod tricennalis baptizatur</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ut in Jeremia et Daniele.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-lc3-Dd1e412">
          <head xml:id="gom-lc3-Hd1e414">Versus 25</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e416">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e418" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_25@1-12">Qui fuit Mathathiae, qui fuit Amos, qui fuit Nahum, qui fuit Hesli.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-lc3-Rd1e421"><name xml:id="gom-lc3-Nd1e422" ref="#Bede">BEDA.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e425"><seg type="qs">Mathath qui per Salomonem descendit</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">qui per carnalem generationem ostenditur factus Filius hominis.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-lc3-Dd1e435">
          <head xml:id="gom-lc3-Hd1e437">Versus 29</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e439">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e441" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_29@13-15">Qui fuit Levi.</quote>
            Non autem hi quatuor qui hoc loco inferuntur Jacob filii fuerunt, sed quod eorum nominibus participabant.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e445">
            <pb ed="#P" n="0253B"/>
            <ref xml:id="gom-lc3-Rd1e449" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_29@13-15"/>
            <ref xml:id="gom-lc3-Rd1e451"><name xml:id="gom-lc3-Nd1e452" ref="#Bede">BEDA.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e455"><seg type="qs">Quasi nominibus alludens quod in illis figuratum est</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">genera virtutum diversa praecederent.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-lc3-Dd1e464">
          <head xml:id="gom-lc3-Hd1e466">Versus 31</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e468">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e470" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_31@12-12">Nathan.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-lc3-Rd1e473"><name xml:id="gom-lc3-Nd1e474" ref="#Bede">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e477"><seg type="qs">Quod Matthaeus per Salomonem</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">cui judicium a Deo rege defertur: <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e483" source="http://scta.info/resource/hebr7_17@6-11">Sacerdos est in aeternum secundum ordinem Melchisedech.</quote></seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-lc3-Dd1e488">
          <head xml:id="gom-lc3-Hd1e490">Versus 37</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e492">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e494" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_37@3-3">Mathusale.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-lc3-Rd1e497"><name xml:id="gom-lc3-Nd1e498" ref="#Ambrose">AMBR.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e501">Anni Mathusale ultra diluvium numerantur, significat Christum, cujus vita aetatem nescit.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e504">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e506" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_37@4-6">Qui fuit Enoch.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-lc3-Rd1e509"><name xml:id="gom-lc3-Nd1e510" ref="#Bede">BEDA.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e513"><seg type="qs">A baptizato Dei Filio usque ad Deum Patrem ascendens, septuagesimo gradu Enoch ponit</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quos in resurrectione immutabili Dei sapientiae contemplandae per saecula <pb ed="#P" n="0253C"/> monstrat esse jungendos.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-lc3-Dd1e524">
          <head xml:id="gom-lc3-Hd1e526">Versus 38</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e528">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e530" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_38@6-6">Seth.</quote>
            Seth posterior Adae filius, non siletur, ut cum duae populi sint generationes, significet Christum in posteriore potius quam in priore generatione numerandum.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-lc3-d1e534">
            <quote xml:id="gom-lc3-Qd1e536" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc3_38@10-12">Qui fuit Dei.</quote>
            A Filio Dei generatio incipit, terminatur in Filium Dei, praecedit creatus in figura, ut sequatur natus in veritate; praeit factus ad imaginem, ut propter eum imago descendat.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
